---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';import Intro from '../components/Intro.astro';import BrandText from '../components/BrandText.astro';
const questions=[['Can you help with documents and IT as well as websites?','Yes. I offer document creation, including resumes and business documents, plus IT support for businesses and homes. Describe what you need in the project form and I’ll confirm how I can help.'],['Do I need to know anything about websites?','No. Bring your goals and questions. We’ll work through the content, design choices, and features together.'],['Are the portfolio samples real client projects?','They are original design concepts for fictional businesses. They show different approaches to layout and interaction, without claiming client results or commissions.'],['Will my website look like one of the samples?','Only if that direction fits your business. The samples start a conversation about what you like; your design, content, and functionality are scoped around you.'],['How much will my website cost?','The quote depends on pages, content, functionality, integrations, and ongoing support. You’ll receive a written scope and price before deciding to proceed.'],['How long does a project take?','Timing depends on the scope, content readiness, and review process. We agree on the schedule after discussing the project.'],['Can you help with hosting, domains, and business email?','Yes, those can be included in the scope. We’ll identify who owns and manages each account, how renewals work, and any recurring provider costs.'],['Can I update the website myself?','We can include editing access and guidance for the content you want to manage. A care arrangement can cover updates you prefer to hand over.'],['Can my site accept bookings or payments?','Those features can be scoped with appropriate providers. This TemVora preview does not process payments or reserve calendar slots.'],['How do I get help with an existing project?','Use the support desk to prepare your request. You can copy it, open Gmail in your browser, use your device’s email app, or download it. A tracked automatic ticket service is not connected yet.'],['What if I need to cancel?','Cancellation, completed work, third-party charges, and any refund arrangements need to be defined in your agreed project terms. The policy page is still awaiting final business terms.']];
---
<PageLayout title="Frequently asked questions"><main id="main"><Intro label="FAQ" title="A few things, cleared up." copy="Practical answers before we get started."/><section class="shell page-content faq-layout"><aside class="faq-nav"><p>Something else on your mind?</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/contact/">Ask me →</a></aside><div>{questions.map(([q,a])=><details><summary>{q}</summary><p><BrandText text={a}/></p></details>)}</div></section></main></PageLayout>
